<title>USA: Pacific National Bank Q3 shr rises [CORRECTED 01:15 GMT, 09/10].</title>
<headline>Pacific National Bank Q3 shr rises [CORRECTED 01:15 GMT, 09/10].</headline>
<text>
<p>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif, Oct 6 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			 Sept 30, 1996	     Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.35		    0.32</p>
<p> Net			803,000		 728,000</p>
<p>		  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.11		   $0.66</p>
<p>(Corrects per share figures for nine month periods from $0.66 and $0.32)</p>
<p> Net		   2,553,000		 1,478,000</p>
<p>NOTE:Q3 net income negatively affected by a special assessment of $300,000 levied by the FDIC following passage of legislation in September to recapitalize the SAIF.</p>
<p>Pacific National is wholly-owned subsidiary of PNB Financial Group and responsible for the majority of the company's earnings and assets.</p>
</text>
